  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Smooths the 5 pad samples of each axis (smooth_samples) into cursor_x and cursor_y, in pad units. When a result differs from the raw value (pad_x_raw, pad_y_raw) by 5 or more, pad_spread gets the difference and cursor_x = cursor_y = 1. When both results are below 5, both become 0. Sets pad_read_enable. Jump table entry $0906."},
    {"at":109,"placement":"line","text":"Smooths the 5 samples in smooth_buffer. Each step puts (s[i] + 2 * s[i+1] + s[i+2]) / 4 into s[i]: 3 steps, then 1 step. The result in s[0] is the sum of the samples with the weights 1, 4, 6, 4, 1, divided by 16. It does not sort."},
    {"at":169,"placement":"line","text":"Adds A to sample_sum (16 bits)."},
    {"at":181,"placement":"line","text":"Divides sample_sum by 4."}
  ],
